Emmy\, WGA & NAACP Image Award-nominated writer\, producer\, actor\, and co
 
median. He stars in the Apple TV+ series The Studio and previously co-wrote
 
\, produced\, and starred in the Lionsgate comedy feature The Blackening. H
 
is prolific television credits include Brooklyn Nine-Nine\, The Amber Ruffi
 
n Show\, and The Upshaws. Perkins has been recognized by Variety\, Vulture\
 
, and The New York Times as a definitive modern comedic voice. Door Time: 6
 
:30pm (front bar opens: 5:30pm). Show Time: 7:30pm. 21 & over w/ valid\, go
 
vernment-issued photo ID. General Admission standing & seating. Seating is 
 
1st come 1st served & not guaranteed. Arrive early for best selection. If y
 
ou have an accessibility request\, please email thebellhouse@livenation.com
 
 prior. No outside food\, drink. $.25 per each ticket sold for a majority o
 
f events at The Bell House benefits Comedy Gives B Tickets & info: https://
 
